<title>SOUTH KOREA: Trigem 1996 net rises 4.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Trigem 1996 net rises 4.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			    (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					  6.4  vs   6.1</p>
<p>    Turnover				 856.6  vs 651.2</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain		     2.5  vs   0.12</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  11.6  vs  10.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)	  8  vs  10</p>
<p>Note - Trigem Computer Co Ltd, a specialised computer manufacturer, said its paid-in capital rose to 44.9 billion won at the end of 1996 from 34.6 billion won at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
</text>
